  "html": "<article id=\"post-4979\" class=\"container post-4979 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized area-of-service-air-ducts area-of-service-dehumidifiers area-of-service-humidifiers area-of-service-greenville-sc-indoor-air-quality type-of-service-installations\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">Breathe Cleaner, Fresher Air with iWave-R</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2020-12-07T16:06:00+00:00\">December 7, 2020</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2025-04-12T01:07:17+00:00\">April 12, 2025</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1710\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-changing-an-air-filter-scaled.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service technician changing an air filter\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-changing-an-air-filter-scaled.jpg 2560w, /images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-changing-an-air-filter-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-changing-an-air-filter-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-changing-an-air-filter-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-changing-an-air-filter-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-changing-an-air-filter-2048x1368.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">IMPROVING INDOOR AIR QUALITY</h4>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Are members of your family more susceptible to allergies or viruses in your home?</li>\n\n<li>Have you noticed odors from pets, cooking or from your air conditioning system?</li>\n\n<li>Are you tired of seeing sunbeams or tiny floating particles in the room?</li>\n\n<li>Are static electricity shocks an issue in your home?</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You might want to get a <a href=\"https://carolinaheating.mojopsg.xyz/services/indoor-air-quality/\">air purification system</a>!</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">MEET THE IWAVE-R AIR PURIFIER</h4>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iWave is an air purifying device that installs in any duct air conditioning system .  When air passes over the iWave, ions produced by the device reduce pathogens, allergens, particles, smoke and odors in the air, creating a healthy environment without producing any harmful byproducts.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iWave uses patented technology, called needle-point bi-polar ionization, to create equal amounts of positive and negative ions.  When these ions are injected into the air stream, they break down passing pollutants and gases into harmless compounds like oxygen, carbon dioxide, nitrogen and water vapor (see illustration below).</p>\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">THE IWAVE DIFFERENCE</h4>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Proven technology – over 200,000 installations</li>\n\n<li>Actively purifies the whole house!</li>\n\n<li>Kills mold, bacteria and viruses</li>\n\n<li>Reduces allergens, odors, smoke and particles</li>\n\n<li>Maintenance free</li>\n\n<li>No replacement parts</li>\n\n<li>Self-cleaning design</li>\n\n<li>Installs in any duct air conditioning system</li>\n\n<li>Three-year warranty</li>\n\n<li>And last but not least, iWave works against SARS-CoV-2 (Covid 19)</li>\n\n<li>Please note: The iWave air purifier does not replace your conventional high quality air filter!</li>\n</ul>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio has-black-background-color has-white-color text-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<lite-youtube videoid=\"KRx9nADStoA\"></lite-youtube></div>\n</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a></div></div>\n\n                </div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n    <footer class=\"entry-footer container has-gray-light-background-color has-background py-5\">\n        <div>\n\t<h3 class=\"h2\">Recommended Reads:</h3>\n\t<a href=\"/about-us/blog\">Read All Blog Posts</a>\n\t<div class=\"my-4 nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-contain